  "content": "<h1>火把投擲</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amber-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Amber-iamkaf?style=for-the-badge&label=Requires&color=#ebb134\" alt=\"Amber\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/iamkaf/mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/iamkaf/mod-issues?style=for-the-badge&color=#eee\" alt=\"Issues\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1207469438719492176?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=DISCORD&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fiamkaffe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/KoFi-iamkaf?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&logoColor=#30d1e3&label=Support Me&color=#30d1e3\" alt=\"KoFi\"></a></p>\n<p>丟出火把來照亮洞穴和隧道。也支援紅石火把。</p>\n<h3>使用方法</h3>\n<p>在合成格中將兩支火把組合成可投擲的火把。將其放在手中並右鍵點擊即可丟出。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/torchtoss/screenshot1.png\" alt=\"Throwable torch recipe\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/torchtoss/screenshot2.png\" alt=\"Throwable soul torch recipe\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/torchtoss/screenshot3.png\" alt=\"Throwable redstone torch recipe\"></p>\n<h3>當前計劃</h3>\n<p>修復錯誤並添加請求的功能。</p>\n<p>感謝您的支持！</p>\n<h2>圖片</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iAEBLkX.gif\" alt=\"Throwing a torch\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/torchtoss/screenshot4.png\" alt=\"It works with soul and redstone torches!\"></p>\n<h2>協助翻譯 Torch Toss</h2>\n<p>想幫忙將此模組翻譯成您的語言嗎？加入社區翻譯項目：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi18n.kaf.sh%252fprojects%252ftorch-toss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">貢獻翻譯</a></p>\n<p>🇺🇸 🇪🇸 🇧🇷 🇫🇷 🇩🇪 🇷🇺 🇹🇷 🇯🇵 🇰🇷 🇨🇳</p>\n<h2>常見問題</h2>\n<p><strong>問：我可以在哪裡詢問這裡未列出的問題？</strong></p>\n<p>答：在此處 <a href=\"https://github.com/iamkaf/mod-issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創建問題</a> 或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 並給我發消息。</p>\n<p><strong>問：你能把它移植到 [MC 版本/模組載入器] 嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>答：如果有足夠多的人請求，我會撥出時間處理，但這確實是單人開發，所以可能需要一些時間。</p>\n<p><strong>問：我可以把它包含在我的模組包中嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>答：可以，不需要署名或詢問。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HV5WgTksaB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/iamkaf/modresources/refs/heads/main/pages/common/discord.png\" alt=\"Join our Discord\"></a></p>\n<h2>更多由我開發的模組</h2>\n<table>\n<tr>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gentle-hurt-cam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/WqioinYz/645237016700abc77814892b6fcbdab350918864_96.webp\" alt=\"Gentle Hurt Cam\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gentle-hurt-cam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Gentle Hurt Cam</strong></a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mochila\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/IWGxWQWM/69e080a8c10a2e6af74fdb418a89285ff929c0fc.png\" alt=\"Mochila\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mochila\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mochila</strong></a>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snapshears\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/yiKUfwkf/f6960cf371c8c2299ccf1cbd473f2162ae689b85_96.webp\" alt=\"SnapShears\" width=\"64\"></a><br>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snapshears\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>SnapShears</strong></a>\n  </td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>兼容性</h2>\n<p>如果您發現任何問題，請告訴我。</p>\n<h2>致謝</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>我優秀的社區成員。</li>\n<li>以及最重要的，<strong>Aris</strong>，因為他總是陪伴在我身邊。</li>\n</ul>",
